 the word 'Socialist' into the Preamble?\",\"hi\":\"किस संशोधन ने उद्देशिका (प्रस्तावना) में 'समाजवादी' शब्द जोड़ा?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"The First Amendment\",\"hi\":\"प्रथम संशोधन\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"The Twenty-fourth Amendment\",\"hi\":\"चौबीसवाँ संशोधन\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"The Forty-second Amendment\",\"hi\":\"बयालीसवाँ संशोधन\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"The Forty-fourth Amendment\",\"hi\":\"चवालीसवाँ संशोधन\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified with: Constitution, Preamble footnote, printed p. 31; Evidence locator: Preamble footnote 1, printed page 31; Direct clickable source(s): The Constitution of India, diglot edition: https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/88cca69e868e50b217f855be2fb8bdba.pdf; Confidence: high; Originality: independently written; no PYQ, textbook exercise, coaching question, or copyrighted explanation has been copied.\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India, diglot edition\",\"institution\":\"Government of India, Legislative Department\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/88cca69e868e50b217f855be2fb8bdba.pdf\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Preamble footnote 1, printed page 31\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"RAILWAY\",\"STATE_ONEDAY\",\"STATE_PCS\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"cdac5dc3-2951-4d25-be5f-afa75bc2c447\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Why is the Preamble often described as a 'key' to the Constitution?\",\"hi\":\"उद्देशिका (प्रस्तावना) को प्रायः संविधान की 'कुंजी' क्यों कहा जाता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Because it is an independent source of every enforceable constitutional power\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि यह प्रत्येक प्रवर्तनीय संवैधानिक शक्ति का स्वतंत्र स्रोत है\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Because it overrides the clear wording of an Article whenever the two appear inconsistent\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि स्पष्ट अनुच्छेद-भाषा से असंगति होने पर यह उसे अधिलिखित कर देती है\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Because it exhaustively states every institution, power and remedy in the Constitution\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि यह संविधान की प्रत्येक संस्था, शक्ति और उपचार का संपूर्ण विवरण देती है\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Because it identifies the Constitution's source, broad governmental character and principal objectives, thereby assisting interpretation\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि यह संविधान के स्रोत, शासन के व्यापक स्वरूप और प्रमुख उद्देश्यों को बताकर व्याख्या में सहायता करती है\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"Kesavananda Bharati para 552; NIOS Lesson 5, section 5.4\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Kesavananda Bharati Sripadagalvaru v. State of Kerala\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/jonew/judis/29981.pdf\",\"citation\":\"(1973) 4 SCC 225\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Senior Secondary Political Science (317), Lesson 5\",\"institution\":\"NIOS\",\"url\":\"https://digital.nios.ac.in/content/317en/317EL5.pdf\"}],\"evidence_locator\":\"Kesavananda para 552, PDF p.83; NIOS section 5.4, printed p.48 / PDF p.4\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"RAILWAY\",\"STATE_ONEDAY\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"cd0a4bed-a974-4352-b992-65a0600de129\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"In the Preamble, which classification correctly separates the character of the Indian State from the objectives to be secured to citizens?\",\"hi\":\"उद्देशिका (प्रस्तावना) में भारतीय राज्य के स्वरूप और नागरिकों के लिए सुनिश्चित किए जाने वाले उद्देश्यों को कौन-सा वर्गीकरण सही रूप से अलग करता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Justice, liberty and equality describe the State; sovereign and democratic are remedies\",\"hi\":\"न्याय, स्वतंत्रता और समता राज्य का स्वरूप बताते हैं; संपूर्ण प्रभुत्व-संपन्न और लोकतंत्रात्मक उपचार हैं\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Sovereign, Socialist, Secular, Democratic and Republic describe the State; justice, liberty, equality and fraternity state the objectives\",\"hi\":\"संपूर्ण प्रभुत्व-संपन्न, समाजवादी, पंथनिरपेक्ष, लोकतंत्रात्मक और गणराज्य राज्य का स्वरूप बताते हैं; न्याय, स्वतंत्रता, समता और बंधुता उद्देश्य बताते हैं\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Republic and fraternity are Fundamental Duties; justice and liberty are Schedules\",\"hi\":\"गणराज्य और बंधुता मूल कर्तव्य हैं; न्याय और स्वतंत्रता अनुसूचियाँ हैं\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"All the expressions are enforceable Fundamental Rights in identical terms\",\"hi\":\"सभी अभिव्यक्तियाँ समान रूप से प्रवर्तनीय मौलिक अधिकार हैं\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified with: Constitution, Preamble, printed p. 31; Evidence locator: Preamble, printed page 31; Direct clickable source(s): The Constitution of India, diglot edition: https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/88cca69e868e50b217f855be2fb8bdba.pdf; Confidence: high; Originality: independently written; no PYQ, textbook exercise, coaching question, or copyrighted explanation has been copied.\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India, diglot edition\",\"institution\":\"Government of India, Legislative Department\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/88cca69e868e50b217f855be2fb8bdba.pdf\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Preamble, printed page 31\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"RAILWAY\",\"STATE_ONEDAY\",\"STATE_PCS\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"cbe8d148-7b44-47c9-b313-5f65f8e6d1d9\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Consider the following statements: 1. Article 14 protects any person. 2. Article 15(1) prohibits specified discrimination against citizens. 3. Article 16(1) guarantees equality of opportunity in State employment to citizens. Which are correct?\",\"hi\":\"निम्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार कीजिए: 1. अनुच्छेद 14 का संरक्षण प्रत्येक व्यक्ति को प्राप्त है। 2. अनुच्छेद 15(1) नागरिकों के विरुद्ध निर्दिष्ट आधारों पर भेदभाव का निषेध करता है। 3. अनुच्छेद 16(1) नागरिकों को राज्य के अधीन नियोजन में अवसर की समानता प्रदान करता है। उपर्युक्त में से कौन-से कथन सही हैं?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"1 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 1\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"1 and 2 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 1 और 2\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"1, 2 and 3\",\"hi\":\"1, 2 और 3\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"2 and 3 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 2 और 3\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-16: Constitution of India; NCERT Class IX and XI; NIOS and Supreme Court official documents where applicable.\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2026)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/76b9f1c47176fc65accc160f19c982b7.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Preamble; Articles 14-21, 25, 37-39A, 42, 46 and 51A, as applicable to the question\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Democratic Politics-I, Class IX, Chapter 2: Constitutional Design (Reprint 2025-26)\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/iess402.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Printed pp. 28-30; learner-facing meanings of Justice, Liberty, Equality and Fraternity\"},{\"title\":\"Indian Constitution at Work, Class XI, Chapter 10: The Philosophy of the Constitution (Reprint 2026-27)\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/keps210.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Printed pp. 225-240; individual freedom, social justice, equality, fraternity and common national identity\"}],\"evidence_locator\":\"Legislative Department, Constitution of India, 2026 Hindi-English edition, Articles 14-16, PDF pp. 36-38\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"cbbd32b7-ab38-4cf1-93ed-d81ba2d8cee0\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"With reference to the background of the Preamble, according to NCERT, what was the principal importance of the Objectives Resolution?\",\"hi\":\"उद्देशिका (प्रस्तावना) की पृष्ठभूमि के संदर्भ में, NCERT के अनुसार उद्देश्य प्रस्ताव का प्रमुख महत्त्व क्या था?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"It encapsulated the aspirations and values that later received institutional expression in the Constitution\",\"hi\":\"उसने उन आकांक्षाओं और मूल्यों को समाहित किया जिन्हें बाद में संविधान में संस्थागत अभिव्यक्ति मिली\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Created the Supreme Court immediately\",\"hi\":\"तुरंत सर्वोच्च न्यायालय की स्थापना की\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Repealed the Government of India Act, 1935 by itself\",\"hi\":\"स्वतः भारत शासन अधिनियम, 1935 को निरस्त कर दिया\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Functioned as the first Finance Act of independent India\",\"hi\":\"स्वतंत्र भारत के प्रथम वित्त अधिनियम के रूप में कार्य किया\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"NCERT Chapter 1, PDF p. 18\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Indian Constitution at Work, Chapter 1\",\"institution\":\"NCERT\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/keps201.pdf\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"PDF p.18: Objectives Resolution encapsulated the aspirations and values behind the Constitution\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"cab860d3-8594-4198-b8d9-a35135c69fac\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Why is the statement “constitutional equality always forbids every special provision” incorrect?\",\"hi\":\"यह कथन क्यों गलत है कि “संवैधानिक समानता प्रत्येक प्रकार के विशेष उपबंध को अनिवार्यतः निषिद्ध करती है”?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Because Article 14 has been repealed\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि अनुच्छेद 14 निरस्त हो चुका है\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Because equality applies only during elections\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि समानता केवल चुनावों में लागू होती है\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Because the Preamble rejects equality\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि उद्देशिका (प्रस्तावना) समानता को अस्वीकार करती है\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Because Articles 15 and 16 themselves permit specified special provisions and reservation measures within their terms\",\"hi\":\"क्योंकि अनुच्छेद 15 और 16 स्वयं अपनी शर्तों के भीतर निर्दिष्ट विशेष उपबंधों और आरक्षण उपायों की अनुमति देते हैं\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-16: Constitution of India; NCERT Class IX and XI; NIOS and Supreme Court official documents where applicable.\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2026)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/76b9f1c47176fc65accc160f19c982b7.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Preamble; Articles 14-21, 25, 37-39A, 42, 46 and 51A, as applicable to the question\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Democratic Politics-I, Class IX, Chapter 2: Constitutional Design (Reprint 2025-26)\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/iess402.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Printed pp. 28-30; learner-facing meanings of Justice, Liberty, Equality and Fraternity\"},{\"title\":\"Indian Constitution at Work, Class XI, Chapter 10: The Philosophy of the Constitution (Reprint 2026-27)\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/keps210.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Printed pp. 225-240; individual freedom, social justice, equality, fraternity and common national identity\"}],\"evidence_locator\":\"Legislative Department, Constitution of India, 2026 Hindi-English edition, Articles 15(3)-(6) and 16(4)-(6), PDF pp. 37-39\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"ca4f1c44-829e-49df-9e15-f65417e5f344\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Which set correctly identifies the textual changes made to the Preamble by the Forty-second Amendment?\",\"hi\":\"कौन-सा समूह बयालीसवें संशोधन द्वारा उद्देशिका (प्रस्तावना) में किए गए पाठगत परिवर्तनों की सही पहचान करता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Federal, Parliamentary and Judicial\",\"hi\":\"संघीय, संसदीय और न्यायिक\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Liberty, Equality and Justice\",\"hi\":\"स्वतंत्रता, समानता और न्याय\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Republic, Democracy and Fraternity\",\"hi\":\"गणराज्य, लोकतंत्र और बंधुता\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Socialist, Secular and Integrity\",\"hi\":\"समाजवादी, पंथनिरपेक्ष और अखंडता\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"Constitution, Preamble amendment footnotes p. 31\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (diglot, as on 1 May 2026)\",\"institution\":\"Government of India, Legislative Department\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/88cca69e868e50b217f855be2fb8bdba.pdf\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Preamble amendment footnotes, printed p.31\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"RAILWAY\",\"STATE_ONEDAY\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"c92da389-83b3-4cc8-b0c2-e78b9a606dee\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Article 38(2) directs the State particularly to minimise inequalities in:\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 38(2) राज्य को विशेष रूप से किन क्षेत्रों में विद्यमान असमानताओं को न्यूनतम करने का निर्देश देता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Income, status, facilities and opportunities\",\"hi\":\"आय, प्रतिष्ठा, सुविधाएँ और अवसर\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Only religious doctrine\",\"hi\":\"केवल धार्मिक सिद्धांत\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Only parliamentary tenure\",\"hi\":\"केवल संसदीय कार्यकाल\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Only judicial salaries\",\"hi\":\"केवल न्यायिक वेतन\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale