्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार कीजिए: 1. अनुच्छेद 19(1)(a) नागरिकों को वाक् और अभिव्यक्ति की स्वतंत्रता प्रदान करता है। 2. अनुच्छेद 21 प्रत्येक व्यक्ति के जीवन और व्यक्तिगत स्वतंत्रता की रक्षा करता है। 3. अनुच्छेद 25(1) लोक व्यवस्था, सदाचार और स्वास्थ्य के अधीन है। उपर्युक्त में से कौन-से कथन सही हैं?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"1, 2 and 3\",\"hi\":\"1, 2 और 3\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"1 and 2 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 1 और 2\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"2 and 3 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 2 और 3\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"1 only\",\"hi\":\"केवल 1\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-16: Constitution of India; NCERT Class IX and XI; NIOS and Supreme Court official documents where applicable.\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2026)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/76b9f1c47176fc65accc160f19c982b7.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Preamble; Articles 14-21, 25, 37-39A, 42, 46 and 51A, as applicable to the question\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Democratic Politics-I, Class IX, Chapter 2: Constitutional Design (Reprint 2025-26)\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/iess402.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Printed pp. 28-30; learner-facing meanings of Justice, Liberty, Equality and Fraternity\"},{\"title\":\"Indian Constitution at Work, Class XI, Chapter 10: The Philosophy of the Constitution (Reprint 2026-27)\",\"institution\":\"National Council of Educational Research and Training (NCERT)\",\"url\":\"https://ncert.nic.in/textbook/pdf/keps210.pdf\",\"citation\":\"Printed pp. 225-240; individual freedom, social justice, equality, fraternity and common national identity\"}],\"evidence_locator\":\"Legislative Department, Constitution of India, 2026 Hindi-English edition, Articl